{"id":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q053","title":"第53題","version":"3","batch":"115-1-med1","sourceSha256":"d7fff7299e44a7768876250644386016f2c62a24418249fe391596e0f09007a5","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_3ef145365d388191bf193b0a8de61beb","sourceAnchor":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q053","shortHtml":"<div><p>既有題庫解析（作者未另標示）</p><div><div><div><div><div><p>動作電位傳導速度由纖維直徑與髓鞘決定。纖維越粗，內阻越低；有髓鞘可跳躍式傳導，因此粗且有髓鞘的神經纖維傳導最快。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>","html":"<div><div><h2>第53題</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><b>原題答案：</b>C</p></div><div><div><div><h3>閱讀詳解</h3><p>傳導最快的組合是<strong>粗且有髓鞘</strong>，選 C。粗軸突讓局部電流沿軸突內部傳播時的阻力較小；髓鞘則減少節間膜的電流漏失，讓下一個郎飛結更快達到閾值。</p><p>有髓纖維在郎飛結集中再生動作電位，形成<strong>跳躍式傳導</strong>；無髓纖維則沿連續的膜面逐段再生。所謂「跳躍」是動作電位再生位置的差異，不是訊號在空間中離開軸突跳過一段。</p></div><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:960px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.7391304347826086\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/144f81d2413f4ade5f4defbeadd71de91868d29a44d7544a266a5176cfe34482.png\" alt=\"髓鞘與郎飛結的跳躍式傳導\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"552\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/144f81d2413f4ade5f4defbeadd71de91868d29a44d7544a266a5176cfe34482.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>髓鞘與郎飛結的跳躍式傳導</p><p>沿下方紅色箭頭找郎飛結（Node of Ranvier）。上方放大圖顯示開啟的離子通道讓鈉離子流入，局部電流使下一個結去極化。此圖以許旺細胞形成的周邊神經髓鞘為例。</p><p>Helixitta，<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Propagation_of_action_potential_along_myelinated_nerve_fiber_en.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Propagation of action potential along myelinated nerve fiber</a>，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>。使用 Commons 既有 PNG 預覽，圖像像素未另修改。</p></figcaption></figure><div><h3>選項辨析</h3><dl><dt>A</dt><dd>髓鞘有利快速傳導，但細軸突缺少較大直徑的優勢。</dd><dt>B</dt><dd>細軸突加上無髓鞘，兩個通常有利速度的條件都欠缺。</dd><dt>C</dt><dd>正確。較大直徑與髓鞘同時有利傳導速度，是四項中最快的一般組合。</dd><dt>D</dt><dd>直徑較大有利，但仍需沿無髓膜面連續傳導，不能勝過同樣粗且有髓鞘的組合。</dd></dl></div><div><h3>一起記：速度、大小與振幅不同</h3><div><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>變化</th><th>傳導重點</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>軸突直徑增加</td><td>軸突內部的縱向電阻減少，傳播通常加快</td></tr><tr><td>增加正常髓鞘覆蓋</td><td>減少漏流，動作電位主要在郎飛結再生</td></tr><tr><td>髓鞘受損</td><td>漏流增加，可使傳導變慢；嚴重時不能有效激活下一段</td></tr><tr><td>刺激強度增加</td><td>不是把單一動作電位越推越大；結構造成的速度差異要分開看</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><p>本題未提供實際直徑，所以 A 的「細且有髓」與 D 的「粗且無髓」不能只憑兩個標籤做精確速度排名；不影響 C 具有兩項優勢的判斷。</p></div><details><summary>來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/12-4-the-action-potential\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax Anatomy and Physiology 2e，The Action Potential</a>：連續／跳躍式傳導、軸突直徑及全有全無反應</li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/35-2-how-neurons-communicate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax Biology，How Neurons Communicate</a>：髓鞘漏流、郎飛結再生與去髓鞘造成減速</li><li><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/6245357/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Waxman，Determinants of conduction velocity in myelinated nerve fibers</a>：有髓纖維的節間距離等結構影響速度，不能只用有髓標籤推精確速率</li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Propagation_of_action_potential_along_myelinated_nerve_fiber_en.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Propagation of action potential along myelinated nerve fiber</a></li><li><a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a></li></ul></details></div></div></div>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"原題答案：C"}